<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title page-title-animated" data-split-text>ABOUT US</h1>
    <p class="page-desc" data-reveal>Fashion that moves with you</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section about-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-hero-grid" data-reveal>
      <div class="about-hero-text">
        <h2 class="section-title">Born in Karachi.<br />Worn worldwide.</h2>
        <p>BA GGY is a streetwear label obsessed with silhouettes. We make wide-leg denim and oversized tees for people who treat clothing like armor — functional, expressive, and built to last.</p>
        <p>Every piece is cut from heavyweight cotton, garment-dyed in small batches, and stitched in factories we personally visit. No dropshipping, no fast fashion, no compromises.</p>
        <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-primary">Shop the Collection</a>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero-img">
        <img src="/public/images/idea.jpg" alt="BA GGY aesthetic reference" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-values">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h2>What we stand for</h2>
        <p>Three principles, every piece.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="value-grid">
      <div class="value-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="value-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Built to last</h3>
        <p>14oz denim, 280gsm cotton, double-stitched seams. We design for the next five years, not the next five weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="value-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Made in Pakistan</h3>
        <p>Every garment is stitched by skilled craftspeople in Karachi and Lahore. Fair wages, real factory floors, no middlemen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="value-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M3 6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-7l-5 4v-4H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Honest pricing</h3>
        <p>PKR pricing with no hidden fees, COD nationwide, and 15-day returns. What you see is what you pay.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
